WEBVTT

00:00:02.140 --> 00:00:03.430
<i>Anime Ja Nai
It's not Anime!</i>

00:00:05.230 --> 00:00:06.520
<i>Anime Ja Nai
It's not Anime</i>

00:00:08.310 --> 00:00:11.320
<i>Hontou no koto sa
It really is real!</i>

00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:13.530
<i>GUNDAM</i>

00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:13.530
<i>MOBILE SUIT</i>

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:16.280
<i>Minna ga neshizumatta yoru
In the night when everyone else was lost in their sleep...</i>

00:00:16.280 --> 00:00:18.620
<i>Mado kara sora wo miru to
I looked at the sky through the window...</i>

00:00:18.620 --> 00:00:23.540
<i>Tottemo sugoi mono wo mita n' da
...and there I saw such a great thing!</i>

00:00:25.620 --> 00:00:28.840
<i>Otona wa dare mo warai-nagara
All the adults told me with a great big laugh...</i>

00:00:28.840 --> 00:00:31.340
<i>Terebi no misugi to iu kedo
"You've been watching way too much television again!"</i>

00:00:31.340 --> 00:00:34.920
<i>Boku wa zettai ni zettai ni
But I would never, ever...</i>

00:00:34.920 --> 00:00:37.140
<i>Uso nanka itte 'nai
...tell any kind of lie!</i>

00:00:39.640 --> 00:00:45.520
<i>Joushiki to iu megane de
This world of ours...</i>

00:00:46.140 --> 00:00:51.020
<i>Boku-tachi no sekai wa
...cannot be viewed through...</i>

00:00:51.940 --> 00:00:54.820
<i>Nozokeya shinai no sa
...the glasses of common sense.</i>

00:00:54.820 --> 00:00:58.320
<i>Yume wo wasureta
You old earthlings...</i>

00:00:58.320 --> 00:01:02.830
<i>furui chikyuu-jin yo
...who have forgotten your dreams!</i>

00:01:04.540 --> 00:01:07.830
<i>Anime Ja Nai! Anime Ja Nai!
It's not Anime! It's not Anime!</i>

00:01:07.830 --> 00:01:10.330
<i>Fushigi na kimochi
Such a wonderful feeling!</i>

00:01:11.040 --> 00:01:12.420
<i>Anime Ja Nai
It's not Anime!</i>

00:01:14.340 --> 00:01:15.840
<i>Anime Ja Nai
It's not Anime!</i>

00:01:17.340 --> 00:01:20.140
<i>Hontou no koto sa
It really is real!</i>

00:01:22.010 --> 00:01:25.020
<i>Hontou no koto sa
It really is real!</i>

00:01:32.910 --> 00:01:37.040
Chara took Shinta hostage
to escape from the Argama.

00:01:37.040 --> 00:01:41.040
It wasn't easy to deal with, since we
were also attacked by a Ga-Zowmn!

00:01:41.040 --> 00:01:43.610
There's also this
goofball Madchar here,

00:01:43.610 --> 00:01:46.450
and the time it takes to form
the Double Zeta is a real problem.

00:01:46.450 --> 00:01:50.580
But, since they didn't kill me,
I guess I'm stronger now.

00:01:50.580 --> 00:01:54.220
I suppose it was another
test God was giving me!

00:01:56.900 --> 00:02:01.020
HAMAN'S BLACK SHADOW

00:02:36.450 --> 00:02:39.330
Lady Haman apparently
likes summer weather.

00:02:39.330 --> 00:02:40.870
It was like this last time, wasn't it?

00:02:40.870 --> 00:02:42.900
Yes. She's kept it like this.

00:02:44.650 --> 00:02:47.510
Sometimes it's good to feel
the harshness of winter.

00:02:57.070 --> 00:02:59.550
Master Glemy Toto
is here to see you.

00:02:59.550 --> 00:03:02.120
I see. Send him in.

00:03:02.120 --> 00:03:04.520
It's been a while, Lady Haman.

00:03:04.520 --> 00:03:08.630
You've done well, Glemy Toto.
I've heard about your exploits.

00:03:08.630 --> 00:03:12.670
No, the Endra was lost.
I'm ashamed of myself.

00:03:12.670 --> 00:03:16.340
Never mind that. Think of it as
an expensive lesson you've learned.

00:03:16.340 --> 00:03:17.600
l shall.

00:03:17.600 --> 00:03:20.040
The port seemed very active.

00:03:20.040 --> 00:03:22.410
Preparations for our main
force to land on Earth.

00:03:22.410 --> 00:03:24.460
This time, I'll be going as well.

00:03:24.460 --> 00:03:26.810
You're going to Earth
yourself, Lady Haman?!

00:03:26.810 --> 00:03:29.050
It will build morale
if I go there.

00:03:29.050 --> 00:03:33.050
The Titans are destroyed, and the
AEUG's organization is in tatters.

00:03:33.050 --> 00:03:35.990
With opposition so weak right now,

00:03:35.990 --> 00:03:38.990
it's a perfect chance for us to
seize the Earth Federation government.

00:03:38.990 --> 00:03:41.090
I see.
A direct move on the Earth.

00:03:42.110 --> 00:03:44.430
Besides, I've obtained
something interesting.

00:03:44.430 --> 00:03:46.430
l plan to take it to Earth.

00:03:46.430 --> 00:03:47.700
What could it be?

00:03:47.700 --> 00:03:49.470
A Psyco Gundam.

00:03:50.520 --> 00:03:53.240
But do you have anyone
who can handle it?

00:03:53.240 --> 00:03:56.740
What about the Newtype
corps you're organizing?

00:03:56.740 --> 00:04:00.710
Lady Haman, that's just a
rumor the gossips are spreading.

00:04:00.710 --> 00:04:03.120
As you wish, but I'll entrust
the Psyco Gundam to you.

00:04:03.120 --> 00:04:05.070
You're going to Earth
with me, Glemy.

00:04:05.070 --> 00:04:09.520
Of course I'll accompany you.
For my debt to you, Lady Haman.

00:04:09.520 --> 00:04:11.590
You flatter me.

00:04:41.070 --> 00:04:42.940
Can't believe my luck!

00:04:42.940 --> 00:04:45.490
They've got so many dummy
asteroids scattered around here...

00:04:45.490 --> 00:04:48.130
that they'd never notice an
extra one or two floating in.

00:04:59.420 --> 00:05:04.370
Something's making my heart ache,
but it feels so good. What can it be?

00:05:12.170 --> 00:05:16.390
I know this ache!
It's that pilot!

00:05:21.580 --> 00:05:23.630
There we go!

00:05:33.960 --> 00:05:37.380
The Double Zeta's pilot
has come here! It has to be!

00:05:37.760 --> 00:05:40.860
Elpeo Ple, no running!
This is the palace!

00:05:40.860 --> 00:05:43.280
I'm in a hurry!
It's fine!

00:05:43.280 --> 00:05:44.050
Ple!

00:05:46.080 --> 00:05:48.520
People at Axis
sure are lively!

00:05:48.520 --> 00:05:50.720
Absolutely not!
This is an exception!

00:05:50.720 --> 00:05:53.490
She's a bad example.
Please pretend you didn't see that.

00:05:53.490 --> 00:05:56.470
I'm not that good an actor.

00:05:59.950 --> 00:06:02.390
I'm going to the residential
block for a while!

00:06:02.390 --> 00:06:03.900
Miss Ple!

00:06:04.350 --> 00:06:06.810
They could transport
this with a crane!

00:06:06.810 --> 00:06:08.610
This is such a waste of effort!

00:06:08.610 --> 00:06:10.710
We're like ants.

00:06:10.710 --> 00:06:12.510
The ants have it better.

00:06:12.510 --> 00:06:15.580
At least they get some
sweet sugar to eat, occasionally.

00:06:18.670 --> 00:06:21.490
Haven't shaken off your gravity
legs yet, huh? Get with it!

00:06:21.490 --> 00:06:23.820
You okay, Beecha?

00:06:24.970 --> 00:06:28.530
Quit picking on us!
Why, you...!

00:06:31.450 --> 00:06:36.540
Bastards! Bastards, bastards,
bastards, bastards! BASTARDS!

00:06:39.090 --> 00:06:40.610
Don't waste food!

00:06:40.610 --> 00:06:41.980
Shut up!

00:06:41.980 --> 00:06:44.910
Beecha, I've had
enough of this life.

00:06:44.910 --> 00:06:46.110
I hate it, too!

00:06:46.110 --> 00:06:48.610
Life on the Argama
was way better than this!

00:06:48.610 --> 00:06:49.230
Let's go back.

00:06:49.230 --> 00:06:50.620
To the Argama?

00:06:50.620 --> 00:06:51.320
Yeah.

00:06:51.320 --> 00:06:54.020
We couldn't!
How would we face them?

00:06:54.020 --> 00:06:56.970
Use your head!
We'll rescue Leina.

00:06:56.970 --> 00:06:58.820
No one will complain
if we do that!

00:06:58.820 --> 00:07:00.130
Yeah!

00:07:00.130 --> 00:07:03.800
Okay, now that's decided,
we take action!

00:07:15.790 --> 00:07:17.920
I must be more
tired than l thought.

00:07:18.160 --> 00:07:21.350
The hatch to residential
block 3 is now closing.

00:07:21.350 --> 00:07:24.380
Those entering the area
should please hurry.

00:07:24.380 --> 00:07:26.620
The hatch to residential
block 3 is now closing.

00:07:26.620 --> 00:07:31.320
Wow... It's like the
uptown area of Shangri-La!

00:07:31.320 --> 00:07:34.690
Although I can't say
I like the lack of a sky.

00:07:34.690 --> 00:07:36.160
Big Brother!

00:07:38.850 --> 00:07:41.720
You came here looking
for me, didn't you?

00:07:41.720 --> 00:07:44.340
I'm Elpeo Ple!
How do you do?!

00:07:44.340 --> 00:07:47.580
It's a pleasure, but have
we met somewhere before?

00:07:47.580 --> 00:07:50.310
Oh, come on,
you already forgot?

00:07:50.310 --> 00:07:52.210
Huh?

00:07:52.760 --> 00:07:55.680
Sorry, but you've
got the wrong guy.

00:07:56.130 --> 00:07:57.220
Wait!

00:07:57.220 --> 00:07:59.090
I'm in a hurry. Later!

00:07:59.090 --> 00:08:01.700
No! Stay with me!

00:08:01.700 --> 00:08:06.130
Hey! Lemme go!
I can't breathe!

00:08:09.950 --> 00:08:11.860
Didn't that look
like Judau just now?

00:08:11.860 --> 00:08:14.800
It couldn't be,
but he sure looked like him.

00:08:25.860 --> 00:08:28.310
What, apples again?!

00:08:28.310 --> 00:08:31.220
Man! Look at the
mess we made!

00:08:31.220 --> 00:08:33.520
These apples sure taste good!

00:08:33.520 --> 00:08:35.760
Are you the owner?

00:08:35.760 --> 00:08:37.090
Here you go.

00:08:37.090 --> 00:08:38.220
It's here!

00:08:38.220 --> 00:08:39.990
Can you really eat all that?

00:08:39.990 --> 00:08:41.290
Of course!

00:08:41.290 --> 00:08:41.990
Here.

00:08:41.990 --> 00:08:42.600
What?

00:08:42.600 --> 00:08:44.030
Hold it.

00:08:48.750 --> 00:08:50.100
Feed me.

00:08:50.100 --> 00:08:52.640
Oh, for crying out loud...

00:08:53.520 --> 00:08:54.910
Yum!

00:08:54.910 --> 00:08:57.110
I've come here before.

00:08:57.110 --> 00:08:58.910
Oh.

00:09:01.060 --> 00:09:02.180
Big Brother?!

00:09:02.180 --> 00:09:04.920
What do you think?
Isn't the Axis city beautiful?

00:09:04.920 --> 00:09:06.820
Huh? Oh, yes.

00:09:06.820 --> 00:09:09.890
I'd show you more of it
if we had the time.

00:09:12.240 --> 00:09:16.130
Oh, is that a dress shop?
I want a dress!

00:09:16.130 --> 00:09:17.400
Dress?

00:09:17.810 --> 00:09:20.370
That's right. We'll be away
from Axis for a while.

00:09:20.370 --> 00:09:22.450
We need to buy
some new clothes.

00:09:22.450 --> 00:09:24.400
Hey! Stop in front
of that store.

00:09:24.400 --> 00:09:25.340
Sir!

00:09:25.340 --> 00:09:27.010
What's your name, Big Brother?

00:09:27.010 --> 00:09:29.610
Judau. Judau Ashta.

00:09:30.560 --> 00:09:33.810
By any chance, did you live
in Shangri-La at Side 1?

00:09:33.810 --> 00:09:35.680
l was born and
raised here at Axis.

00:09:35.680 --> 00:09:37.880
I've never seen the Earth
from this close up.

00:09:37.880 --> 00:09:41.320
Then how do you know me?
It's weird, isn't it?

00:09:41.320 --> 00:09:43.520
Yeah, it really is.

00:09:44.270 --> 00:09:45.700
Hey, do me a favor!

00:09:45.700 --> 00:09:46.490
What?

00:09:46.490 --> 00:09:47.990
Kiss me!

00:09:49.180 --> 00:09:52.600
Hey! Isn't that moving
kind of fast for a first date?

00:09:53.280 --> 00:09:56.570
I came here to find my
little sister! Don't bug me!

00:09:56.570 --> 00:10:00.900
Little sister?
I wonder if that was her...

00:10:00.900 --> 00:10:02.270
You know her?!

00:10:02.270 --> 00:10:03.610
l have a feeling I saw her.

00:10:03.610 --> 00:10:04.410
Where?!

00:10:04.410 --> 00:10:05.410
Thataway.

00:10:05.410 --> 00:10:06.110
Let's go!

00:10:06.110 --> 00:10:08.310
No! l haven't
finished it yet!

00:10:08.310 --> 00:10:09.880
Then I'll eat it!

00:10:10.730 --> 00:10:14.060
Wow, cool!
Oh, there's some on you.

00:10:15.670 --> 00:10:18.260
This would look
good on Roux Louka.

00:10:18.260 --> 00:10:20.900
Except I don't know
her measurements.

00:10:21.880 --> 00:10:23.200
Leina, what are...?

00:10:24.750 --> 00:10:26.240
You can't escape!

00:10:26.240 --> 00:10:27.900
What do we do
with all these apples?

00:10:27.900 --> 00:10:29.900
Maybe we can sell them
to the other fruit stands.

00:10:29.900 --> 00:10:31.900
That guy running the stand
was so damn greedy!

00:10:31.900 --> 00:10:34.610
He didn't have to make poor
people like us buy all these!

00:10:35.560 --> 00:10:37.330
Isn't that Leina?!

00:10:38.560 --> 00:10:41.830
Leina! What are you
doing here?!

00:10:41.830 --> 00:10:44.200
Beecha! Mondo!
He's after me!

00:10:44.200 --> 00:10:45.840
Leina, where are you?!

00:10:45.840 --> 00:10:46.690
This way!

00:10:47.270 --> 00:10:49.940
It's no use hiding!
Come out!

00:10:49.940 --> 00:10:52.160
Want some apples?
You can have them for free.

00:10:52.160 --> 00:10:54.230
We just need some
help transporting them.

00:10:54.230 --> 00:10:55.490
There!

00:10:56.380 --> 00:10:57.630
It's a waste, but...

00:10:57.630 --> 00:10:58.860
Move it, Leina!

00:11:01.220 --> 00:11:02.530
Thief!

00:11:06.190 --> 00:11:09.110
Out! The military hereby
commandeers this car!

00:11:09.110 --> 00:11:11.940
Come on, gobble it at once
like you did before.

00:11:12.530 --> 00:11:15.480
If you don't, I won't take you.
Do it!

00:11:15.480 --> 00:11:17.380
All right.

00:11:25.540 --> 00:11:28.040
Wow, that's amazing!

00:11:28.040 --> 00:11:31.430
Okay, you promised.
Tell me where my little sister is.

00:11:31.430 --> 00:11:32.560
Sure!

00:11:33.080 --> 00:11:34.300
Again?

00:11:34.300 --> 00:11:36.440
You'll be fine.
It feels better up here.

00:11:42.560 --> 00:11:43.440
What?!

00:11:44.980 --> 00:11:49.180
Hot rodders? You got guys like
that here in Axis, too, huh?

00:11:49.180 --> 00:11:50.680
I like lively people.

00:11:50.680 --> 00:11:52.280
This way!

00:11:58.470 --> 00:12:01.990
Okay, we're grabbing
that mobile suit!

00:12:13.820 --> 00:12:15.510
Hey! What are you doing?!

00:12:15.510 --> 00:12:17.930
Taking this mobile suit.

00:12:17.930 --> 00:12:19.310
That's not a toy!

00:12:19.310 --> 00:12:21.280
Beecha, are you
sure about this?

00:12:21.280 --> 00:12:24.120
I was always better than Judau
at driving petit mobile suits.

00:12:24.120 --> 00:12:27.860
Listen, my brother is here!
I'm sure I've just seen him!

00:12:28.070 --> 00:12:31.220
That settles it. That really
was Judau we saw before!

00:12:31.220 --> 00:12:32.220
Out!

00:12:32.220 --> 00:12:34.820
Don't you know what'll happen
if you fool with military stuff?!

00:12:34.820 --> 00:12:36.630
Like I care?!

00:12:37.380 --> 00:12:38.860
Sorry!

00:12:40.950 --> 00:12:41.970
There!

00:12:46.290 --> 00:12:48.770
You think you can
get away with this?!

00:12:48.770 --> 00:12:51.340
What's happening?
Who's in that mobile suit?!

00:12:51.340 --> 00:12:52.850
Some crazy kids!

00:12:52.850 --> 00:12:54.850
Two boys and a girl?

00:12:54.850 --> 00:12:55.850
Yeah!

00:12:55.850 --> 00:12:59.640
Leina! Come down at once
or I'll punish you very severely!

00:12:59.640 --> 00:13:01.050
A severe punishment?

00:13:01.050 --> 00:13:03.090
Heh, rich people are so cute.

00:13:03.090 --> 00:13:04.270
Who would come down?!

00:13:04.510 --> 00:13:06.030
Beecha, step on him.

00:13:06.030 --> 00:13:07.980
Yeah!

00:13:07.980 --> 00:13:10.130
Hey! Stop that!

00:13:12.550 --> 00:13:13.580
Leina!

00:13:13.580 --> 00:13:16.470
If you don't follow us,
we'll let you live!

00:13:17.750 --> 00:13:21.310
Huh? The hatch isn't closing?
This is the switch, isn't it?

00:13:21.310 --> 00:13:24.460
This mobile suit doesn't
have the hatch installed yet!

00:13:24.460 --> 00:13:26.750
We can't go out in this!

00:13:26.750 --> 00:13:29.220
We can grab some
normal suits on the way out!

00:13:29.220 --> 00:13:30.880
That's...!

00:13:31.260 --> 00:13:34.120
What the...? Why's there a
mobile suit in the city?

00:13:34.120 --> 00:13:35.180
What's it doing?

00:13:35.370 --> 00:13:38.720
Hey! It's the guys who
have been bullying us!

00:13:41.180 --> 00:13:42.400
Dammit, l missed!

00:13:42.400 --> 00:13:44.530
Stop!
You can't just kill people!

00:13:44.530 --> 00:13:46.870
Those guys have been
treating us like slaves!

00:13:46.870 --> 00:13:48.070
We should blow them to bits!

00:13:48.070 --> 00:13:50.500
You'd kill defenseless people
with a mobile suit?!

00:13:50.500 --> 00:13:51.610
Let go, Leina!

00:13:51.610 --> 00:13:53.240
This is what
lowdown bad guys do!

00:13:53.240 --> 00:13:54.870
They are lowdown bad guys!

00:13:54.870 --> 00:13:56.280
Stop!

00:14:00.260 --> 00:14:04.180
Holy...!
This place looks like a palace!

00:14:04.830 --> 00:14:07.020
And Leina's really
in a place like this?

00:14:07.020 --> 00:14:09.020
Uh-huh. Let's get going!

00:14:09.020 --> 00:14:10.560
R-Right...

00:14:14.340 --> 00:14:15.660
Good work!

00:14:16.050 --> 00:14:18.060
Uh, thanks, guys.

00:14:18.980 --> 00:14:22.030
Are you the princess of
this palace, by any chance?

00:14:22.030 --> 00:14:23.740
Not exactly.

00:14:34.930 --> 00:14:38.020
This feeling... Char Aznable?

00:14:38.020 --> 00:14:41.150
No, it's different. Who, then?

00:14:43.470 --> 00:14:45.760
So, where's Leina?!

00:14:45.760 --> 00:14:47.230
I don't sense her now.

00:14:47.230 --> 00:14:48.370
"Don't sense her"?

00:14:48.370 --> 00:14:51.840
Maybe I'll try taking a bath.
Then I'll sense her. I just know it!

00:14:52.010 --> 00:14:54.300
Look, little girl...!

00:14:54.850 --> 00:14:56.840
Okay! I'm taking a shower!

00:14:56.840 --> 00:14:58.400
Hey!

00:15:04.060 --> 00:15:07.610
You gotta be kidding me.
Ple!

00:15:08.600 --> 00:15:10.480
Whatever!

00:15:14.240 --> 00:15:17.620
ls Leina really in
a place like this?

00:15:18.070 --> 00:15:19.830
Who are you?!

00:15:20.140 --> 00:15:21.870
State your assignment and ID number!

00:15:21.870 --> 00:15:24.030
Um, I'm...

00:15:24.030 --> 00:15:25.050
BYE!

00:15:25.050 --> 00:15:26.800
Halt!

00:15:30.850 --> 00:15:32.500
Dead end!

00:15:33.590 --> 00:15:36.380
- It won't open!
- Where did he run?!

00:15:36.380 --> 00:15:38.130
Yikes!

00:15:53.240 --> 00:15:55.260
Judau! Huh?

00:15:59.550 --> 00:16:03.000
Ow! Owwy! Owwy! Owwy!

00:16:05.120 --> 00:16:07.540
Don't plant roses here!

00:16:18.330 --> 00:16:20.820
Impossible! This child...?

00:16:20.820 --> 00:16:21.890
Huh?

00:16:21.890 --> 00:16:25.140
I'm asking the questions here.
Who do you belong to, boy?

00:16:25.140 --> 00:16:28.990
Um, hi. I got lost, and...
this place sure is big, huh?

00:16:28.990 --> 00:16:30.700
State your assignment!

00:16:31.050 --> 00:16:33.880
You can't trick me!
Who are you?!

00:16:33.880 --> 00:16:35.570
Lady Haman!

00:16:37.120 --> 00:16:39.240
I'll ask again.
Who do you belong to?

00:16:39.420 --> 00:16:43.470
Even if I explain "who"...
I guess you won't get it.

00:16:43.470 --> 00:16:44.820
I'll hit you this time.

00:16:44.820 --> 00:16:46.810
D-Don't shoot!

00:16:52.240 --> 00:16:54.350
What the...?

00:16:55.100 --> 00:16:56.630
You won't talk?!

00:16:56.630 --> 00:16:58.550
STOP!

00:17:01.310 --> 00:17:05.030
Hey! What kind of idiot would
escape toward the palace?!

00:17:05.800 --> 00:17:07.870
- Almost!
- They're getting away!

00:17:07.870 --> 00:17:09.940
This fight is totally one-sided!

00:17:09.940 --> 00:17:11.670
You don't know
what we've been through!

00:17:11.670 --> 00:17:13.840
You just had to eat good food
and practice the piano!

00:17:13.840 --> 00:17:14.740
Move!

00:17:17.690 --> 00:17:19.550
I'll just stomp 'em!

00:17:20.760 --> 00:17:22.780
What's wrong, Beecha?

00:17:22.780 --> 00:17:24.150
It came off.

00:17:24.930 --> 00:17:26.120
Do something!

00:17:26.120 --> 00:17:27.450
Such as?!

00:17:27.450 --> 00:17:29.020
Stop this thing!

00:17:33.840 --> 00:17:35.590
What?!

00:17:37.910 --> 00:17:39.600
Halt!

00:17:39.920 --> 00:17:42.500
I'm from the Argama, okay?!

00:17:44.590 --> 00:17:47.430
The Argama? As I thought.

00:17:47.430 --> 00:17:51.610
How could the Argama's crew
ever infiltrate our Axis?!

00:17:53.300 --> 00:17:54.520
Stop!

00:17:54.520 --> 00:17:56.680
Like I'm going to stop?!

00:18:04.510 --> 00:18:06.200
H-Hey!

00:18:07.940 --> 00:18:11.500
Who was that woman?
l saw something strange, though.

00:18:22.260 --> 00:18:25.480
That's the ship I saw
back at Moon Moon!

00:18:25.480 --> 00:18:28.090
Of course!
Leina must still be in there!

00:18:34.300 --> 00:18:36.820
Hey, mister, what happened to
the dummy asteroids that were here?

00:18:36.820 --> 00:18:39.460
Asteroids? They were in
the way, so we're dumping them.

00:18:39.460 --> 00:18:41.390
Huh?! Where?!

00:18:41.390 --> 00:18:42.940
Through that hatch over there.

00:18:43.180 --> 00:18:46.600
Through the hatch? Oh, no...

00:18:47.250 --> 00:18:49.870
Hey! Where are you going
without a normal suit?!

00:18:50.390 --> 00:18:52.500
Through this one, huh?

00:18:57.710 --> 00:19:00.550
There's air in here!
Where is it?

00:19:00.550 --> 00:19:01.510
Found it!

00:19:07.800 --> 00:19:10.120
The air's going!

00:19:17.600 --> 00:19:20.330
Leina must still
be on that ship.

00:19:20.330 --> 00:19:21.530
Where is it going?

00:19:21.530 --> 00:19:23.100
Judau!

00:19:25.890 --> 00:19:27.710
Where are you going, Judau?

00:19:27.710 --> 00:19:30.490
Huh?!
Elpeo Ple, is that you?!

00:19:30.490 --> 00:19:32.210
You got it!

00:19:32.210 --> 00:19:35.210
You can pilot mobile suits?!

00:19:35.970 --> 00:19:38.080
Why'd you come
out here, Judau?

00:19:38.080 --> 00:19:40.890
Your little sister was
in the palace garden.

00:19:41.200 --> 00:19:43.990
She was in the
mobile suit that crashed.

00:19:43.990 --> 00:19:46.390
No... that's a lie!

00:19:49.080 --> 00:19:52.780
Never mind your sister.
Play with me! Come out!

00:19:52.780 --> 00:19:55.600
Stop it! I'm not
wearing a normal suit!

00:19:55.600 --> 00:19:58.000
I'm not wearing one,
either, so we're even!

00:19:58.000 --> 00:19:59.740
No one's even here!

00:20:01.620 --> 00:20:02.840
Judau!

00:20:04.360 --> 00:20:05.380
What?

00:20:07.530 --> 00:20:09.020
Judau!

00:20:09.020 --> 00:20:10.120
Iino?

00:20:11.370 --> 00:20:14.290
You're coming between
me and Judau?!

00:20:21.340 --> 00:20:23.600
Stop it! You can't do this!

00:20:23.600 --> 00:20:27.600
I hate when people get mad!
I just want to play with Judau!

00:20:37.160 --> 00:20:38.430
Iino!

00:20:38.430 --> 00:20:41.590
Stop it, Elpeo Ple!
You're really making me mad!

00:20:41.590 --> 00:20:43.480
Judau! Why?

00:20:45.570 --> 00:20:48.320
No! All right, all right!

00:20:54.540 --> 00:20:55.590
Judau.

00:20:56.410 --> 00:20:57.910
Now, Judau!

00:20:57.910 --> 00:20:59.410
Right!

00:21:05.720 --> 00:21:09.340
Ple, a girl like you
shouldn't be killing people!

00:21:09.340 --> 00:21:12.260
Someone like you
shouldn't be a pilot!

00:21:12.260 --> 00:21:13.310
Judau...

00:21:24.940 --> 00:21:28.490
I just wanted
to play with Judau!

00:21:31.030 --> 00:21:33.230
Ple, stop this!

00:21:45.460 --> 00:21:48.610
Judau, you meanie!
Why won't you play with me?!

00:21:48.610 --> 00:21:51.050
I won't because
you're in that mobile suit!

00:21:51.050 --> 00:21:54.300
You're mean, and I hate you!
I hate you, Judau!

00:21:56.210 --> 00:21:58.490
Hey! Elpeo Ple!

00:21:59.310 --> 00:22:03.110
Fine! I'll get Glemy
to console me!

00:22:03.110 --> 00:22:05.900
Stupid Judau!

00:22:12.360 --> 00:22:16.610
They made a little girl like that
into a mobile suit pilot?

00:22:18.990 --> 00:22:21.210
Judau, where are you going?

00:22:21.210 --> 00:22:23.410
Leina's still at Axis!

00:22:23.970 --> 00:22:27.720
This time, I'm rescuing her!
Tell them that back on the Argama!

00:22:46.100 --> 00:22:51.770
<i>michi mo nai areta genya ni
Amidst the wasteland without any roads...</i>

00:22:53.280 --> 00:22:58.990
<i>reeru wo tsukuru no wa kurushii koto sa
...it's difficult to lay down your rails.</i>

00:23:01.200 --> 00:23:03.490
<i>dakedo
However...</i>

00:23:03.490 --> 00:23:09.790
<i>tooi mukou mo shiranakucha ikenai
You've gotta know what's on the other side...</i>

00:23:09.790 --> 00:23:16.880
<i>boku-tachi wa kore kara nanda
...it's all from here on for us.</i>

00:23:16.880 --> 00:23:21.300
<i>"yume wo wasureta kodomo-tachi" to
"Children will forget their dreams"...</i>

00:23:21.300 --> 00:23:23.680
<i>hito wa iu
...is what they say.</i>

00:23:26.600 --> 00:23:33.900
<i>aa jidai ga naiteiru
Ah, the times are crying.</i>

00:23:47.600 --> 00:23:52.270
For Leina's sake, I return to Axis,
with the Double Zeta as an offering.

00:23:52.270 --> 00:23:55.890
But I wasn't counting on
Beecha and Mondo taking it!

00:23:55.890 --> 00:24:00.050
On top of that, the Argama's
testing its new cannon.

00:24:00.050 --> 00:24:04.220
and now I'm the target!
Ple, wake up!

00:24:04.830 --> 00:24:08.870
Next time, on Gundam ZZ:
"Ple and Axis."

00:24:05.750 --> 00:24:08.870
Next Time

00:24:05.750 --> 00:24:08.870
PLE AND AXIS

00:24:09.070 --> 00:24:12.520
Please don't fire, Mr. Bright!
